WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:10.000
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Tap the circle to move it along

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.000
In Progress — tap again when it's done

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Or open a task…

5
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.000
…tap Edit…

6
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.500
…pick a priority…

7
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.000
…and a status

8
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.500
Blocked, say

9
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.000
Save

10
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.800
Add Heading groups a project's tasks

11
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.200
Name it

12
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.900
Add

13
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:51.400
Touch and hold a task…

14
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.900
…Move to Heading…

15
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:58.400
…Launch week

16
00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.900
Down to the heading…

17
00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:10.400
…the task sits under it now
